\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Mizoguchi mum on possible coordinated  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Februar 2004\par 03:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Feb 13 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's top financial diplomat, Zembei Mizoguchi, declined to comment on Friday on chances of coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, a day after another senior official said it could not be ruled out.  \par \par \uc2 "I will not comment," Mizoguchi, vice finance minister for international affairs, told reporters when asked if \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  with European authorities to rein in their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 Hiroshi Watanabe, head of the ministry's international division, had said on Thursday that the government could not rule out the possibility of coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 "If coordinated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is necessary, we can't rule out the possibility of it taking place," Watanabe said at a late night briefing.  \par \par \uc2 The yen traded at around 105.40/45 yen to the dollar on Friday, little changed from Thursday's U.S. levels, with traders saying the market was wary over possible \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Japanese authorities.  \par \par \uc2 The Japanese government sold a record seven trillion yen ($66.45 billion) in January to curb the yen's rise against the dollar.  \par \par \uc2 The euro has been lingering near a record high against the dollar, raising speculation over whether the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would step in to bring down the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 Both European and Japanese authorities are worried about the damage to exporters from a surge in their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040213e02d000dq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
